    "text": "Two electric lamps <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> radiate the same power. Their filaments have the same dimensions and have emissivities <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>e</mi> <mi>A</mi> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively. Their surface temperatures are <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>T</mi> <mi>A</mi> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math>. The ratio <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mi>T</mi> <mi>A</mi> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mi>T</mi> <mi>B</mi> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> will be equal to",
