    "text": "The power radiated by a filament is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; (where&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math>emissivity,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>&#963;</mo> <mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math> Stefan&#39;s constant and&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math> surface temperature)<br />Here, <math> <mrow> <mi>e</mi><msup> <mi>T</mi> <mn>4</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> </mrow> </math>constant or <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>e</mi> <mi>A</mi> </msub> <msubsup> <mi>T</mi> <mi>A</mi> <mn>4</mn> </msubsup> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mi>e</mi> <mi>B</mi> </msub> <msubsup> <mo>T</mo> <mi>B</mi> <mn>4</mn> </msubsup> </mrow> </math>",
